541fec24a37123b1e03bed35e1e5.png) we obtain\n![](images/31/31ad69c4ca05aaa0a5b87c66bf5fc0369acb8aa5a870443622dae6a94af62d90.png)\nComputing the determinant ![](images/4d/4d6a32a2a88056ca58bfcc70f57c011ed91cd88747c703a45531cd2b7c133529.png) we get\n![](images/bc/bce9ac17c2d92d59d2c08b08683cabdf7e2967eaec1f3f8971b7eb814b1436b8.png)\nNow, since ![](images/70/70bf5942ca0750d270288199f464c08b2b2cd7d4be1cd1b1ac67269db5fddbde.png) and  ![](images/e9/e98c067307a4f26643da0e4f859761e543ab38ceea1e46a36bbe9f057edaca95.png) the function ![](images/f4/f46326a9b32467a94ead9bda5846b0cf630f013472e283bf20d7260cbebf04a3.png) has a local minimum at ![](images/5e/5e28ee39df67eea47e1396843ce2335220a81d287b2f0449532c7520bc4bf14d.png)\n\n- Evaluating the second derivative at ![](images/7e/7e2b8d0dc4cd944605764e822a791a58cb95bdc4594f4f3058a55ab7fdcb3a01.png) we obtain\n![](images/c0/c0afb3bd05453415a4e4405d3204cf5f003e1b913dee6899507beb6ef55f6b97.png)\nComputing the determinant ![](images/70/706f896b329f2d7da4eb32dd48f7b3f81ab6b7d7b1dbc40181dcb9651fb94ff5.png) we get\n![](images/dd/dd7fd8d8eb625e1661dee2d7d418cf4be1c23f20a90932c4106d4b9b940709c4.png)\nTherefore, ![](images/e5/e505fe33cc7f6db13c021beaddcf71823fe506bc914c45c8c24520d905b1c8d7.png) is a saddle point.\n\nIn conclusion, ![](images/55/557ab1b22319727accc0f327cc1981a28de2f44f4e6c4cba8c55fc9863b3cc81.png) has a local minimum at ![](images/6f/6f22d6fba010e28fb4e39bbeb1d228d2d5fce35b324d55bdf0c209a983f7d970.png) and a saddle point at ![](images/6a/6aed8e1c686dfe44296c0f23dd69bb4442ad30864f5600c63b0ceff16da7b576.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186125006 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124653 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "045854fc-9cad-5005-a306-9550848e25df" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Critical Points of a Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9f20412b-203b-5c4b-bb3d-5d51a9bb3557" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "